      "message": "Why not check that `cose_key.alg` matches `Some(Algorithm::Assigned(_))` in the constructor, allowing this to `-\u003e Algorithm`?\n\nOtherwise, I don\u0027t see the point of `PublicKey`, which can\u0027t be encapsulation of `coset` given that `PublicKey::alg()` is \"leaking\" `coset::iana::Algorithm` out of `bcc.rs` anyway.",
